WEBVTT

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:18.510
I'll show you the clincher

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.650
Shoot me up!

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:43.340
Dodge, Raul!

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:44.810
I can't, it's too fast!

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:48.600
Galaxy Turbo Twister!!

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.740
It's over!!

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:33.460
The Pegasus in the skies! The invincible tag siblings, F-Sangre, have finally been taken down!

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:39.650
The BBA Revolution gets their revenge
in a tag-battle and make it to the finals!

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.120
All right!
We're in the finals!

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:57.670
Now we just gotta
beat Neo-Borg!

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.090
And become world champions!

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.210
Yes, of course, excuse us!

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:03.800
'Cuse us!

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:07.200
What?

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:10.020
My Gaia Dragoon!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.140
And my Dragoon!

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:16.420
Allow me to take
care of your Beyblades!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.510
Hey!

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.040
Give 'em back!

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.930
--My Gaia Dragoon!
--Wait up!

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:28.940
Kinomiya's team has
made it to the finals.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.720
As it should be.

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.320
I don't like this.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.620
Don't like what?

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.400
Don't you want
to battle them?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.150
They've already
fought once today.

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.510
They should still
have damage from it.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:52.110
Which means we'll have the
advantage against the champion.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.100
What's the matter
with you two?

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:01.090
There's nothing more
fearsome than a wounded wolf.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.250
What do you...

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.340
Boris. Sergey.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.680
I need you two
to do me a favor.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.880
A favor?

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.660
Hey, Kyoujyu.

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.860
What are
you trying to do?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.370
My Gaia Dragoon...

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:25.680
I don't have much time.
I have to repair your Beyblades.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.370
Just let me
know if I can help.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:30.830
Repair?

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.660
I'll give you the parts I'm done
checking, so please clean them, Hiromi.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:37.010
Sure thing.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:42.330
We'll start with Gaia Dragoon, which
will be fighting in the first battle.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.260
Kyoujyu, Hiromi...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:48.190
You don't need to
repair my Gaia Dragoon!

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:52.990
I never did any of that junk when I
was playing with it in the mountains.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.040
A cricket?!

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.110
How does your Beyblade
even move with that in it?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.420
Come on, now...

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.040
Well, if that's
what you're doing...

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.600
Takao. Daichi.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:14.530
Don't surprise us like that.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.590
You guys belong over here.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.600
What's the big idea?!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.620
You two need
to take a nap.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:28.930
No way! We can't just lounge around while Kyoujyu and Hiromi are working for us!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:33.070
Are you saying you can't trust
Kyoujyu to repair your Beyblades?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.780
Of course I trust him!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:40.910
Then you both need
to regain your strength

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.830
so you can go all
out in the finals.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.200
That's how you can repay
them for their effort.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.360
Their...

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.600
Fine!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:54.340
I'll trust Kyoujyu!

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:56.000
Yeah. I'll do it.

00:05:56.430 --> 00:06:00.550
Thankfully, there's an exhibition
going on during your break.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:04.110
So with that in mind,
be sure to take a--

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.890
You can't hide what
the body wants.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:14.320
I bet they're still worn
out from their last match.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.810
Just one more to go.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:19.720
Takao. Daichi.
You can do it.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:28.630
I'll help you guys out.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:29.970
Coach...

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:34.050
This is about
all I can do for now.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:36.290
We appreciate the help!

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:40.760
But can Takao and Daichi
beat Kai and Yuriy?

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.200
I don't know.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.580
Aww!

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.210
But I bet they'd
say something like...

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:51.330
"We're the BBA Revolution!"

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.330
"And we'll be sure to win!"

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:55.780
Yes! They really would!

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.960
The BBA Revolution will win!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:05.690
This is a special exhibition
battle before the final match!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.880
Things are getting
exciting over here too!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:15.600
Who will be the last one standing in
these stadiums split into two levels?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.510
Go, Trygator!

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.640
Galux!

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.250
Whoa there!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:28.850
You can have a
little more fun, yeah?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.010
Thanks, Rick!

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:36.170
You two are enemies!
What are you doing?!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.160
Rick, are you turning
your back on the PPB?

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:43.890
It's last Blader standing, which means
we're not on the same side, Rai!

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.580
She's right!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.840
Easy peasy!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.900
What?!

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.920
Sorry, but it's every
Blader for themselves!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.240
What is this?

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:04.500
What's wrong?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.100
One of the gears inside
the Engine Gear is cracked!

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:10.680
What?!

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:13.040
Can't you swap it out?

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:18.380
Replacing the Engine Gear itself
would be the easiest way to do it.

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:23.450
But the one Dragoon uses is brand
new, so it's the only one we've got.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.610
But that means...

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.780
My only choice is to
repair this Engine Gear.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:35.680
But these use special parts, so making
these adjustments will be time consuming.

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:43.730
You're sorely mistaken if you think Draciel is only good for defense!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.330
Then I'll just have
to make my exit!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.700
That's not fair!

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.930
That's Rei for you.
We've both got the same idea.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.580
We need to stall for time, otherwise the
BBA will be at too much of a disadvantage!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:04.130
We want to see Takao and
Kai battle on even ground!

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.690
Wake up, Daichi.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.840
Come on, Daichi...

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.580
The finals!!

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:21.050
What's the big ide--

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.770
What are you doing?!

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:36.040
I woke you up because
the finals are about to start.

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:42.570
Hiromi's cooking is so awful...

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.250
What was that?!

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:50.570
Takao's not up until the second battle, so let the guy sleep a little more...

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.770
I'll let you live for now!

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:59.200
There's only three Beys left in
this special exhibition match!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.970
Who's going to be
the last one standing?

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:10.450
I think this is about as
much time as I can stall for.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:14.380
The crowd's gonna get mad
at us if we stall any longer.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.600
Bring it on, Max!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.400
Go, Draciel!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.780
I did it!!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.250
I beat Rei and Max!

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:43.840
We finally have a winner!
Mao from Baihuzu wins!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:46.380
Xièxie! Thank you!

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.640
Here's your Gaia Dragoon.

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.850
Oh, you finished the repairs? Thanks!

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:58.760
Gaia Dragoon's fighting the first battle, so we repaired it first.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.880
So what about Takao's Dragoon?

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:07.020
The repairs on its Engine Gear
will take a little longer.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.580
Really...

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.880
Everyone's doing their
best, and so will I!

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:17.360
See ya!

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:30.820
There's nothing else we can do.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:35.210
Now we just need to see what kind of
battle the BBA and Neo-Borg will show us.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:39.380
But Takao and Daichi will be at a
disadvantage since they've already battled today.

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:44.860
Takao versus Kai... This battle will be
on a higher level than ever before.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:47.760
That much we can guarantee.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:52.940
We will now conduct the final stage of
the Beyblade world championships!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:56.690
Both teams enter the arena!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.960
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:20.320
These are the two teams to
survive the round-robin battles!

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.970
The BBA Revolution and Neo-Borg!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.450
And the first to make
their entrance is...

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:30.480
Daichi Sumeragi from
the BBA Revolution!

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:33.120
From Neo-Borg...

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:36.400
Yuriy Ivanov enters!

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.770
Wow! I've never heard a
crowd this loud before!

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:44.300
Daichi! You can do it!

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:47.180
If you win, I'll cook
sukiyaki for dinner!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:51.770
Leave it to me, grandpa!
I'm gonna win, no matter what!

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:55.840
I've gotta do my part
if we want to win.

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.600
Hey, where's Takao?

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.760
Kai's gone, too!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:04.530
None of the other
team members are here!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:07.260
What's going on here?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:11.420
Both teams only
brought out one Blader!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.000
What happened to Takao?

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:18.320
Where's Kinomiya?
I hope he didn't chicken out.

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:22.810
He let me handle
you Neo-Borg guys!

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:26.530
And I bet you don't want
your team to see you lose!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.120
What?

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.370
The match is about to start.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.040
Where are you taking us?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.290
Just shut up
and come with me.

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.290
Where are we?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:54.960
What's in here?

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:08.130
Even I don't know
what they're up to.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:11.620
But what I do know is
that you're my prey!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:14.040
So I'm going
to get my revenge!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.860
Now you're talkin'! I couldn't
ask for a better Blader to fight!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.680
So do your worst!

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:36.200
The stage for their final battle will
be the Ganryu Island Stadium!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.290
Fight to your heart's content!

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:46.480
Kyoujyu. Old hag. I won't let
your hard work go to waste!

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:54.880
Now then! The first battle of the
Beyblade world championships finals!

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.730
Are you ready?

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.180
Three! Two! One!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.340
Go, Shoot!

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.300
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.970
Go, Wolborg!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:21.930
He's got enough power to
blow me back with one attack!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:27.620
Last time, he dragged the battle out to
find a weak spot in my special attack.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:42.300
I hope you don't
think that'll work twice!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.200
Go, Wolborg!

00:15:47.690 --> 00:15:51.560
He's stronger than last time!

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:54.440
A wolf's fangs stay sharp!

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.520
Gaia Dragoon!

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:06.780
I need time! You just have to
hang in there, Gaia Dragoon!

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:13.950
Kyoujyu! Takao! I'll hang on
until you guys get here!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.730
It's started.

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:21.560
Will Daichi be okay?

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:26.770
Daichi won't lose so easily,
even against Yuriy.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:31.160
Regardless, we have to
finish Dragoon in time!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.760
What's wrong with Daichi?
He isn't using all of his power!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.850
Did something happen?

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:42.730
Hang in there! We just have to
hang in there, Gaia Dragoon!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.890
Stay on him, Wolborg!

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:50.420
Darn it! I'm gonna lose!

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:53.900
How odd... Is he going to
drag the battle out again?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.840
What's the point of
fighting like that?

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:02.300
There must be a reason why Kinomiya and the rest of them haven't shown.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:05.800
So his strategy must
be to stall for time!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:10.570
But I can't go easy on him!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:14.810
I must win this world championship
tournament, no matter the cost!

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:19.000
I'm not nice enough to
wait for them to show!

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:23.170
Novae Rog!!

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:34.860
Oh no!
Dodge it, Gaia Dragoon!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.380
If we don't hurry,
Daichi's going to lose!

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:42.580
Wait just a
little longer, Daichi...

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.330
Once I insert this part...

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:51.370
Gaia Dragoon!

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.380
You don't know when to quit!

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:58.600
I'll take you down no
matter what it takes!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.840
Are you done yet?

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.180
Are you done yet, Takao?!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.840
Complete!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.040
This is the end!

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:25.720
Gaia Dragoon...!

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.440
Daichi!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.540
Takao! Are the repairs done?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:37.450
Yes! Takao's Dragoon
can fight at full power!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:38.980
Takao!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:40.600
Takao made it!

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:43.140
What took you
so long, Takao?

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:46.210
So you made it, Kinomiya?

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.500
Daichi!
You can stop stalling!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.650
Fight with
everything you've got!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.820
You don't have
to tell me twice!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.320
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:02.720
This is payback for
the whole battle!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:10.060
I'm gonna finish this now!

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.180
Don't think you've won!

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:19.280
Wolborg's about to
unleash its full power!

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:22.060
Wolborg, counterattack!

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:30.490
Both Bladers are ready
to finish each other off!

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:33.490
They continue to
clash at a fast pace!

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.580
Darn it!
I need more power!

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.690
Because I attacked
too much before...

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:42.570
I'm gonna bet it all
on one attack!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:46.500
Go! Great Cutter!

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:56.750
Not gonna happen!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:00.730
Novae Rog!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:09.420
Hit him with the last of
your power! Gaia Dragoon!

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:11.370
He doesn't have
any power left!

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:14.160
Finish him, Wolborg!

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.820
What's this? A Stadium Out!

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:43.200
Both Bladers are
out of the stadium!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.850
Wolborg...

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.310
Daichi!

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:06.320
Gaia Dragoon...

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.540
--Daichi!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.610
Takao... Kyoujyu...

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:16.250
Daichi...

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:24.140
Daichi! Hey! Daichi!

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:26.130
Pull yourself together! Daichi!

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:33.660
Daichi!!

00:22:56.090 --> 00:23:01.020
Sometimes we lose sight
of the path we must take.

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:05.140
We walk around in circles,
lost in a forest for all eternity.

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:10.130
But I will never lose
sight of my path.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.900
Eyes on me, Kinomiya!

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:16.370
I'm right here!

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:22.060
The wind whispers my name.
